<title>INDIA: Earthquake hits Indian state, no damage reported.</title>
<headline>Earthquake hits Indian state, no damage reported.</headline>
<dateline>SRINAGAR, India 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two mild earthquakes hit the Kashmir city of Srinagar on Saturday but there were no immediate reports of injuries or damage, a state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;There were two mild tremors at 4.36 p.m.(1106 GMT),&quot; a state official told Reuters. &quot;No casualties or loss of life were reported.&quot;</p>
